# Optional: enables live Google Gemini narratives in the Friction Insight panel
# and the simulator rationale. WITHOUT a key, Foresight falls back to
# numerically-correct templated text — the demo works fully either way.
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey then copy this file to
# `.env` and paste the key below.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional model override (default: gemini-flash-lite-latest, which has reliable
# free-tier quota; gemini-2.0-flash is often quota-blocked on free keys).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest
